t(3, 1650, """No bills .. calm down .. If every person thought before taking the paths of misguidance, the state of the world would be set right!

Don't be afraid! Calm down. Bad manners and ill intent are not looked at by the standard of Ihsan .. The small who look down on people and are arrogant are very small, because every arrogant one is seized by pride to sin: if he is above the beautiful advice of another and receives that fine, courteous advice with bad manners, saying of the adviser that he is a "nobody" merely because the adviser's followers are very few by the standard of the people of this world, then whoever behaves like this is small, like it or not. And the deeds of the small, which come from the smallness of bad character, are things the "religious" do not do: they are ((deeds we do not look at at all)). They are those who decided to leave this world to the small, for this world is left to the small because it is small; only the small scramble over it, and only the small live in it with bad manners. Have mercy on yourself from all this fear and all this tension, and from all this terror, for you have become exposed in a very shameful way. You do not need all this eagerness to make yourself feel safe! Your daily repetition of ideas that are the same, repeating them every day for a whole year 😀, appears to people as knowledge you are spreading; but whoever understands the matter and understands you knows that the reason for your daily repetition is the state of terror that has seized you. So you set about reassuring yourself and calming yourself by spreading every day things full of illusions from your own mind, while to people it looks like spreading knowledge 😀 So you invent a lot, a lot from your own mind to reassure yourself 😀 Calm down! Calm down 😀""")

